{"type":"text","timestamp":1794527501657,"sessionID":"ses_e2dd83989ffevoEHqeWn41PhPb","part":{"id":"prt_1d22c9185002h9zqhx7lhYuXty","sessionID":"ses_e2dd83989ffevoEHqeWn41PhPb","messageID":"msg_1d22c7bd7001l6hZPsep9wP3pZ","type":"text","text":"Done. T008 created the hook-wiring check and its three-case test.\n\n**Files written**\n- `.skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/hook-wiring-check.cjs`\n- `.skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/tests/hook-wiring-check.test.cjs`\n\n`HW` takes `--root <dir> [--json]`, skips a runtime whose folder is absent, reads the event under `hooks` or at the top level, and prints `ok <runtime>` or `hook-missing <runtime> <file>`. It exits 1 for any missing entry and 2 for a bad flag or missing root. The `--json` shape is `{ root, checks: [{ runtime, file, status }] }` with `ok`, `hook-missing` or `skipped`.\n\n**Verify output**\n\n`node --test .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/tests/hook-wiring-check.test.cjs`\n```\n✔ names a runtime whose prompt entry is absent (24.093208ms)\n✔ passes a runtime whose prompt entry is wired (47.679833ms)\n✔ skips a runtime whose folder is absent (46.139333ms)\nℹ tests 3\nℹ suites 0\nℹ pass 3\nℹ fail 0\nℹ cancelled 0\nℹ skipped 0\nℹ todo 0\nℹ duration_ms 149.946375\nTEST_EXIT=0\n```\n\n`node .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/hook-wiring-check.cjs --root .`\n```\nok claude\nok codex\nok cursor\nok devin\nCHECK_EXIT=0\n```\n\nAdditional evidence: `node --check` passed on both files, the quality gate on the two files reported `p0_blocking: 0`, `p1_open: 0`, `p2_open: 0` with exit 0, a throwaway fixture with no entry printed `hook-missing claude .claude/settings.json` and exited 1, and bad flag and missing root both exited 2. Greps for write APIs and spec/task identifiers in both files printed nothing. `git status` shows only the two new untracked files.\n\nNothing blocked. I did not tick T008 in `tasks.md` and touched no git state.\n\nREPO RULES: prevent-overengineering.md, evidence-and-proof.md, communication.md, communication-handoff.md. Nothing is the operator's to do.","time":{"start":1794527498629,"end":1794527501657}}}
